# WebGPU+TSL Refactor Rules

- Work only on `feature/webgpu-tsl-pipeline` or its sub-branches.
- Do not add or modify legacy WebGL/VTF GLSL in master.
- No production imports of `simulation-state`; use holders and DI.
- Use WebGPURenderer + TSL/NodeMaterial only.
- Update `docs/refactor-webgpu-tsl/PROGRESS.md` (and phase files) for changes.
- Run tests with `npm run test:ci`.
- Use MCP browser tools for UI automation and screenshots.
- Use MCP tools to run browser-based testing (navigation, clicks, screenshots).

# PowerShell + Commands

- Shell commands must be PowerShell syntax (Windows):
  - Env: `$env:VAR = "value"` (not `export VAR=value`)
  - Remove: `Remove-Item -Recurse -Force path` (not `rm -rf`)
  - Chain: `;` or `&&` (PowerShell 7+)
- Tests: use `npm run test:ci` (not `npm test`).
- Build: `npm run build`.
- TS/TSX typecheck: `npx tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit`.
